## 3. Building, Testing, and Running with Bazel

### Run All Unit Tests

```bash
bazel test //tests:all
```

### Execute a Single Simulation Run

```bash
bazel run //src/kiln_sim:main -- \
    --config="$(pwd)/configs/baseline_205mm.textproto" \
    --output_dir="$(pwd)/results"
```

### Verify Input Provenance Against Output Record

```bash
md5sum configs/baseline_205mm.textproto
grep "input_config_md5" results/baseline_205mm_*.out.textproto
```